%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'noteBkgColor': '#fff6bf', 'noteBorderColor': '#c9b200', 'noteTextColor': '#222222'}, 'sequence': {'actorMargin': 35, 'messageMargin': 22, 'boxMargin': 6}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(238,238,238) Consumer - Contabo
    participant R as Consumer application
    participant RX as Receiver
    participant CC as Consumer CP
    participant CD as Consumer DP
    end
    box rgb(255,246,222) TAU VM 1 - edge
    participant PC as Provider CP
    participant PD as Provider DP
    end
    box rgb(240,234,250) TAU VM 2 - data source
    participant S as Data source
    end

    Note over R,S: Edge: provider CP and DP on TAU VM 1
    Note over R,S: Network RTT: consumer to provider CP 40 ms | provider CP to DP same host | provider DP to source 3 ms | provider DP to consumer 40 ms
    Note over R,S: Push, stock EDC 0.14.1, EDC wait 50 ms, 4 CPU / 4 GB per connector
    Note over R,RX: Consumer data platform, simulated
    Note over CD: Not used in a push

    rect rgb(255,235,210)
    Note over R,S: TC3: video frame, 473,603 B (source /tc3/video-frame)
    R->>CC: Catalog request
    CC->>PC: Catalog request (DSP)
    PC-->>CC: Catalog with offers
    CC-->>R: Catalog with offers
    Note over R,PC: 1) Catalog: 209 ms
    R->>CC: Start negotiation
    CC->>PC: Contract request
    PC-->>CC: Contract agreement
    CC->>PC: Verify agreement
    PC-->>CC: Agreement finalized
    loop negotiationPoll
        R->>CC: Poll state, every 0.1 s
    end
    Note over R,PC: 2) Negotiation, once: 2,641 ms
    loop 20 transfers
        R->>CC: Start push transfer, destination = receiver
        CC->>PC: Transfer request
        Note over CC,PC: a) request to provider CP: 100 ms
        PC->>PD: Start data flow
        PC-->>CC: Transfer start
        Note over PC,PD: b) provider CP to DP: 76 ms
        PD->>S: GET payload
        Note over PD,S: c) DP to source: 42 ms
        S-->>PD: Payload
        PD->>RX: POST payload
        Note over RX,S: d) source to receiver: 480 ms
    end
    Note over R,S: 3) One transfer, request to received: 697 ms median (616 ms to 977 ms)
    Note over R,S: TC3 to first data: 3,582 ms, then one transfer per piece of data
    end
